At noon we go together to a restaurant nearby.
The atmosphere at the table is very good.
Today we are not only talking about the new project.
Katrin asks me about my career in Mexico.
"Maya, how long have you been working as a developer?" she asks.
"I have been a software developer for many years already," I answer.
"I studied computer science in Mexico."
"And did you work there too?"
Jonas wants to know.
"Yes, exactly," I say.
"I started at a small company after my studies."
"We programmed great apps there."
Sven nods and eats his pizza.
"I have only been working as a tester for a year," he says.
Nele laughs.
"But you have already found a lot of bugs in that year!" she says to him.
We all laugh together.
It is nice to get to know the team better.
